      "claim": "Bergapten, a methoxy-substituted coumarin-related psoralen, was detected in rat CSF and brain after oral administration, directly demonstrating CNS access for a close structural relative.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C10"],
      "claim": "Urolithin B, a hydroxylated coumarin-like metabolite, was detected in rat brain after intravenous administration, confirming that the coumarin scaffold can cross the BBB.",
